00:05:13.291 --> 00:05:14.459
He moved the American embassy

00:05:14.726 --> 00:05:17.562
there, he recognized our

00:05:17.829 --> 00:05:19.431
sovereignty, leading out of the

00:05:19.698 --> 00:05:22.434
dangerous nuclear deal with

00:05:22.701 --> 00:05:26.438
Iran, he helped the peace

00:05:26.705 --> 00:05:27.606
