00:05:28.607 --> 00:05:29.107
He's done great things.

00:05:29.307 --> 00:05:30.408
I think that he made a big

00:05:31.309 --> 00:05:32.511
mistake with this Kanye west

00:05:32.777 --> 00:05:34.613
thing, and I said so.

00:05:35.280 --> 00:05:36.548
I'm not going to intervene in

00:05:37.115 --> 00:05:37.716
new politics, you know that.

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:40.485
You tried, it's good, you try

